ace) be chained in one `pre-push` script. That surfaces a new failure mode not present before: the internal capture variable `_annals_refs` isn't namespaced, and since pre-push stdin can only be read once, a second chained block (for a different namespace) will call `$(cat)` on already-drained stdin and silently get an empty ref list. Not a regression for single-namespace use and not explicitly in the 7 intended-change list, but worth flagging as a gap in the new multi-namespace capability.\n\n### Export audit (item a)\n\nEvery exported symbol from all 15 old files is present in `annals/src/index.ts`, except: `NOTES_NAME`/`NOTES_REF`/`INCOMING_NAME`/`INCOMING_REF` → replaced by `notesRef()`/`incomingRef()` functions over `NamespaceConfig` (intended, item 2); `KNOWN_KINDS`/`SESSION_MACHINERY_KINDS` → deliberately dropped (intended, item 6, cledger's own copy is a future concern, not part of this extraction). `git.ts`'s `GitRunOptions`/`statusPorcelain`/`revList` and `forge/github.ts`'s `isGitHubOrigin`/`githubDriver` are absent from `index.ts` in **both** old and new — pre-existing, not a regression.\n\n### Grep audit (item d)\n\nNo `\"ev1-\"` or `\"conversation-ledger/v1\"` literals anywhere in `annals/src`. Remaining `\"cledger\"`/`\"conversation-ledger\"` hits are all comments except the four real bugs listed above (items 1–4).","type":"text"}],"role":"assistant"},"context":{"branch":"annals-extraction","cwd":"/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/conversation-ledger","head":"88b10fb5683696dc24ca942f505bc42d4fa3fff7","repo":"git@github.com:evintunador/conversation-ledger.git"},"id":"ev2-482f2e467e57a3de5b6ff1853752bc6d28166da98f44eed7723525e5b0d19fc4","kind":"conversation_turn","occurred_at":"2026-09-01T23:26:51.862Z","producer":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","session_id":"a044dbb5-5e38-4400-bb2a-97061ee33f87","source":"claude-code","source_version":"2.1.258","tool":"cledger","version":"0.26.0"},"raw":{"data":{"agentId":"a4eba8fc0bc16e916","apiBlockIndex":1,"attributio