n — it's a derived summary type (`id`, `source`, `sessionId`, etc.), untouched by the regex, and doesn't need to be. Fine.\n\n**Task (d) JSON.parse'd external structures:** None found — turnbridge never directly parses raw ledger JSON; all reads go through `readEvents`/`EvidenceEvent` from the `conversation-ledger` package. Target-CLI session-file fabrication (`claude-code.ts`, `codex.ts`, `opencode.ts`) writes CLI-native JSON shapes that never contained a `conversation`/`stream` envelope key to begin with — confirmed no rename touched those files.\n\n**Task 5 (import surface):** Turnbridge imports from `\"conversation-ledger\"`: `appendEvents`, `readEvents`, `sortEvents`, `findRepo`, `gitUserIdentity`, `git`, `reAnchorDraft`, plus types `EvidenceEvent`, `RepoInfo`, `EventDraft`. All present in `/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/conversation-ledger/src/index.ts` (branch `annals-extraction`, lines 2-4, 27, 29-37, 52). **No missing imports.**\n\n**Overall verdict:** No real bugs. One cosmetic leftover (`ev1-test-` literal, finding 7) that has zero runtime effect and could be tidied for consistency but doesn't need to block anything.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>53447</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>21</tool_uses><duration_ms>106456</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>","type":"text"}],"operation":"enqueue"},"context":{"branch":"annals-extraction","cwd":"/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/conversation-ledger","head":"88b10fb5683696dc24ca942f505bc42d4fa3fff7","repo":"git@github.com:evintunador/conversation-ledger.git"},"id":"ev2-73a158cae279e4e0b71f4f8f1c9955e7a2d65da74d1d3e570bd5b9d76102b74a","kind":"activity","occurred_at":"2026-09-01T23:22:33.469Z","producer":{"session_id":"a044dbb5-5e38-4400-bb2a-97061ee33f87","source":"claude-code","tool":"cledger","version":"0.26.0"},"raw":{"data":{"content":"<task-notification>\n<task-id>a5e938bfe4fc5154d</task-id>\n<tool-use-id>toolu_01VVJ4WJa5xSm1r2yhkwT1tj</tool-use-id>\n<output-file>/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users